{"product_id":"how-gloves","title":"HOW Gloves","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHOW Gloves\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e are designed for players who demand a smooth, consistent stroke with unrestricted hand movement. Built with a lightweight and flexible construction, these billiard gloves create a low-friction surface between the bridge hand and cue shaft, allowing the cue to glide smoothly through the fingers for greater stroke consistency and control.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe back of the glove features \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ehigh-stretch Lycra\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, providing flexibility and breathability for comfortable play during extended sessions. A \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ereinforced anti-slip palm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e adds stability and durability, helping maintain a secure bridge position while allowing natural movement throughout the stroke.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeatures\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eHigh-stretch \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLycra back\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e for flexibility and breathability\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eReinforced \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eanti-slip palm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e for added stability\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLightweight construction for comfortable extended play\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eClose, comfortable fit without restricting hand movement\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u0